  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the establishment of an Interim Government in August 2024, this 18-month Initiation Plan (IP) aims to enhance the capabilities of interim authorities, national institutions, and civil society in Bangladesh to drive democratic reforms and foster inclusive development. It houses the early phase of UNDP support for democratic and institutional reforms in Bangladesh and the advancement and repositioning of ongoing governance programming. Central to this initiative is a commitment to restor</narrative>
  </description>
